Begin3
Title:           Vi IMproved (vim)
Description:     Improved version of the "vi" editor
Summary:         Improved version of the "vi" editor, one of the standard text editors on UNIX systems. These are the runtime files for VIM. [GPL-compatible, but asks that if you find it useful you make a donation to help children in Uganda through the ICCF. The full license text can be found in README.txt.] DOS 32-bit only (since 7.1).
Keywords:        editor, vi, vim
End
